A 1221 @ The Barrens, 62.4, 37.6 | Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet. Take the crate, the command stick and the manual next to him. In the kraul, let the gopher out near the blueleaf trail and use the stick to make it dig up 6 tubers.
A 1102 @ Thunder Bluff, 36.0, 59.9 | Auld Stonespire. Razorflank's Heart drops from Charlga Razorflank, the last boss. Needs level 29.
A 1109 @ Undercity, 48.8, 69.3 | Master Apothecary Faranell in the Apothecarium. Kraul Guano drops from the bats inside. Needs level 30.
RUN | The entrance is in the far south-west of the Barrens, south of Camp Taurajo, where the road turns towards the Great Lift. Inside: Willix the Importer, near the end, gives an escort quest that also ends with him.
